WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.085
On-Chain Signal Engineer is about analysing blockchain and market data like a careful scientist.

2
00:00:08.485 --> 00:00:11.364
Chain data is precise but low level.

3
00:00:11.364 --> 00:00:16.004
Every metric, such as active addresses or transfer volume,

4
00:00:16.004 --> 00:00:19.044
is a choice about how to aggregate it.

5
00:00:19.044 --> 00:00:22.724
One person can control thousands of addresses,

6
00:00:22.724 --> 00:00:27.044
and one exchange address can serve millions of people.

7
00:00:27.044 --> 00:00:29.044
Activity is not adoption.

8
00:00:30.444 --> 00:00:32.670
Clean before you calculate.

9
00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:39.925
Quarantine impossible records, keep gaps as gaps, and align series on the same calendar,

10
00:00:39.925 --> 00:00:41.986
venue and quote currency.

11
00:00:41.986 --> 00:00:45.696
A daily crypto candle closes at midnight UTC,

12
00:00:45.696 --> 00:00:49.984
about fourteen hours after the Indian market closes.

13
00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.796
State every choice in a calculation.

14
00:00:53.796 --> 00:01:02.576
A daily volatility of three percent is about fifty-seven percent a year using the square root of three hundred and sixty-five days,

15
00:01:02.576 --> 00:01:04.318
the convention for crypto,

16
00:01:04.318 --> 00:01:09.613
but about forty-eight percent using two hundred and fifty-two trading sessions.

17
00:01:11.013 --> 00:01:12.743
Then test ideas honestly.

18
00:01:12.743 --> 00:01:17.448
If you try twenty rules with no real edge at the five percent level,

19
00:01:17.448 --> 00:01:21.047
you should expect one to look significant by chance,

20
00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:26.168
and the chance of at least one false positive is about sixty-four percent.

21
00:01:27.568 --> 00:01:34.171
In the course you will read real blocks, clean and align series, calculate volatility,

22
00:01:34.171 --> 00:01:38.317
correlation and beta, run event studies and backtests,

23
00:01:38.317 --> 00:01:43.154
and learn why look-ahead and survivorship bias flatter results.

24
00:01:43.154 --> 00:01:46.302
This is education, not investment advice.

